BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Fall In for Nancy in Baltimore
DTSTART;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260930T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Los_Angeles:20260930T160000
UID:3b3f0c5ce9c252dce668bef2f6fecdaf@mobilize.us
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://mobilize-uploads-prod.s3.amazonaws.com/u
 ploads/event/PhotOle_1471_20260806210745923510.jpg
DESCRIPTION:Join friends\, neighbors\, nurses\, and healthcare professiona
 ls to meet Nancy Mannion\, DNP\, RN\, as she campaigns to represent Pennsy
 lvania's 11th Congressional District\, just across the Maryland border. Na
 ncy's career as a nurse and healthcare leader reflects the qualities we ne
 ed more of in elected office: integrity\, trust\, strong communication\, e
 vidence-based decision-making\, and the ability to lead calmly through com
 plex challenges. Come meet Nancy\, hear about her vision for the district\
 , share
LOCATION:Baltimore\, MD
URL:https://www.mobilize.us/citizensfornancymannion/event/1004117/
X-SOURCE:Lancaster County Dems (Mobilize)
END:VEVENT
